  "explanation": "The question asks when the Criterion Theatre was built. The sources provide conflicting dates for different Criterion Theatres located in different cities. The most relevant and directly supported answers are:\n\n1. **1932** - This refers to the Criterion Theatre in **Bar Harbor, Maine**, as stated in multiple documents (D1S2, D2S2, D3S6). These clearly indicate that the Bar Harbor Criterion Theatre was built in 1932.\n\n2. **1886** - This refers to the **Criterion Theatre in Sydney, Australia**, as stated in D7S1 and D8S14. These documents explicitly mention the construction date of the Sydney Criterion Theatre.\n\nOther dates like 1925, 1895, 1880s, 29 December 1886, and 1870 either refer to different Criterion Theatres (e.g., Coventry, London) or are not directly relevant to the construction of the theatres mentioned in the question."
